# The binary carries members this battery deliberately does not register. Each
# records its cause here, where the assertion that joins the two rosters reads it
# (gate-sdk/SPEC.md §check-gate-substrate-parity, assertion I).
# unregistered: check-surface-duplication — this tree declares no glossary, for the provenance-seam reason, and the member exits 2 without one
# unregistered: check-producer-liveness — this repo's gates suite is the battery --run-validate itself invokes, so a registered liveness gate would red every validate run against its own lock
